OL,3,GNEWSAHorse racing returns to course
OL,4,Aafter almost a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FHorse racing is returning to Towcester
OL,7,FRacecourse for the first time in almost
OL,8,Fa decade.
OL,10,FThe Northamptonshire course has
OL,11,Fconfirmed the return of National Hunt
OL,12,Fracing for the 2027/28 season.
OL,14,FThe site was closed to horse racing in
OL,15,F2019 after Towcester Racecourse Company
OL,16,FLimited entered into administration
OL,17,Fwith debts of more than #1.3m. However,
OL,18,Fit has continued to host greyhound
OL,19,Fracing events including the English
OL,20,FGreyhound Derby.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
