OL,3,GNEWSAHorse racing returns to course
OL,4,Aafter almost a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Thomas, chief executive of
OL,7,Fmanagement company, Orchestrate, said:
OL,8,F"Seeing dates in the diary for the
OL,9,Ffirst time in nearly a decade is a
OL,10,Fgenuinely exciting moment for everyone
OL,11,Fhere."
